(text "A6 HOLD. Common330R supply plus per-color cathode resistors. GP0/1/2 selects red/green/blue; unused outputs low. Reset/readback/power/brightness/temperature and sealed optics unqualified. No fabrication or physical engine release." (at 25.4 20.32 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left)) (uuid e2481a9e-4063-5b57-a43f-9a47c0db4faa))
