(property "DesignNote" "Candidate open-drain TO92 supervisor with100k pullup. DS20001906E: trip2.564..2.696V over-40..125C;25C trip max2.670V plus25C hysteresis max0.158V gives2.828V release threshold before80..180ms delay under stated load. Combining full-temperature trip max with25C hysteresis gives only a conditional2.854V estimate. Full-temperature/loaded-reset release, leakage, deep brownout and ramps remain holds. This is not a3.0V brownout monitor. A6 conditional development draft, no fabrication/physical qualification." (at 162.56 62.23 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (hide yes)))
