(property "DesignNote" "Common-anode supply series resistor. Prevents an anode/cathode harness-to-ground fault from bypassing every current-limiting resistor. At5.25V and-1%R, zero-drop upper bound16.07mA and0.0844W. Bounds require stated rail/resistance and do not qualify temperature, surge, faults to external supplies, brightness or assembled heat. A6 conditional development draft, no fabrication/physical qualification. Candidate MRS16 order code; availability, TCR/derating, formed body and thermal acceptance pending. Use the declared mounting side and footprint; physical forming, heat and fit acceptance pending." (at 63.5 172.71999999999997 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (hide yes)))
